## Pour sequence

- **G1:** Tonkarome (20%) 248 · Isobutavan 40
- **G2:** Iso E Super 600 · Cedarwood Virginia 500 · Vertofix 300 · Sandalore 240 · Indian Vetiver EO 180 · Amberwood F 20
- **G3:** Ethylene Brassylate 350
- **G4:** Hedione 420 · Alpha Isomethyl Ionone 300 · Linalyl Acetate 196 · Florol 50
- **G5:** Bergamot FCF 340 · Linalool 162 · Lemon FCF 110 · Dihydromyrcenol 104 · Ginger EO 100
- **G6:** Hexyl Acetate (10%) 100 · Allyl Cyclohexyl Propionate (10%) 70 · Vanillin (10%) 20 · Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate (0.1%) 20 · 2-Acetyl Pyrazine (1%) 10 · Cinnamaldehyde (1%) 10 · Black Pepper EO 10

Stir after each group; rest 48 h before wear-testing.
